    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PENTO</strong><br><i>A calm and clever puzzle built around just one extra block.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally developed in 1987 by independent developer Gennadiy Balagurchyk, <strong>PENTO</strong> is a minimalist puzzle game centered around falling five-block shapes. Designed with clarity and precision in mind, it offers focused, elegant gameplay that rewards spatial thinking and careful decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to learn, satisfying to master \u2014 <strong>PENTO</strong> delivers an original experience shaped by logic, geometry, and rhythm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate and place five-block shapes (pentominoes) on a grid to form and clear horizontal lines. As the game progresses, new combinations and placement challenges emerge. There's no rush \u2014 just space, motion, and mental flow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original five-block shape logic and placement mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local score tracking to challenge your personal best</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure \u2014 play at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, distraction-free visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive keyboard controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight \u2014 under 100 MB, runs on almost any PC</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Plans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned updates include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual themes and backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge modes (timed runs, limited moves, puzzle goals)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional music and ambient sound</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who It\u2019s For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PENTO</strong> is perfect for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle fans seeking a fresh and self-contained design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy spatial reasoning and pattern discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamers looking for short, thoughtful sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone who values minimalism and gameplay clarity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One extra block. Infinite new ways to think.</strong></p>",
