_tag\" >Who It\u2019s For</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PENTO</strong> is perfect for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle fans seeking a fresh and self-contained design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy spatial reasoning and pattern discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamers looking for short, thoughtful sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone who values minimalism and gameplay clarity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One extra block. Infinite new ways to think.</strong></p>",
